WESTVIEW

113
00:07:27,322 --> 00:07:28,532
Vamos, Bobcats.

114
00:07:28,615 --> 00:07:32,452
Sois increíbles. Sois increíbles, chicos.
Estupendos, de verdad.

115
00:07:32,536 --> 00:07:36,498
